EzMouse
=======

EzMouse is a modified version of Mousehop (https://github.com/jondkinney/mousehop,
commit 6b9a2733d6b8ca17f61f9d891a660ac295d95e28), which is itself a fork of
lan-mouse. All three are licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or (at your option) any later version; see the LICENSE file.

Changes made for EzMouse:
  - Renamed from Mousehop to EzMouse (binaries, crates, app id, config names,
    mDNS service name).
  - Added portable mode (ezmouse/src/portable.rs): on Windows, the config,
    identity certificate and crash log are stored in a "data" folder beside
    ezmouse.exe instead of %LOCALAPPDATA%.
  - Removed upstream packaging, release and CI infrastructure not used by
    EzMouse.
